# Translate App Documentation Maintenance

## Overview

This rule ensures that documentation for the Arabic Translation Pipeline accurately reflects the current state of the codebase. The translate app is a sophisticated pipeline for processing Arabic texts through translation and database insertion.

## Key Files to Monitor

### Core Application Files

- [main.py](mdc:translate/main.py) - Main entry point with CLI interface
- [data/config.py](mdc:translate/data/config.py) - Configuration constants and author mappings
- [pipeline/split_file.py](mdc:translate/pipeline/split_file.py) - Text splitting functionality
- [pipeline/translate.py](mdc:translate/pipeline/translate.py) - Translation processing
- [pipeline/insert.py](mdc:translate/pipeline/insert.py) - Database insertion
- [pipeline/translation_engine.py](mdc:translate/pipeline/translation_engine.py) - Translation engine logic

