5. **Incomplete Author List**: Ensure all 15 authors are documented
6. **Missing UV Commands**: Ensure all examples use UV package manager
7. **Incomplete Pipeline Description**: Document all 6 translation stages
8. **Python Standards Violations**: Ensure code follows Python 3.12 best practices

